<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-NATAL AND NORTHERN TRANSVAAL DRAW 27-27.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NATAL AND NORTHERN TRANSVAAL DRAW 27-27.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal drew with Northern Transvaal</p>
<p>27-27 (halftime 10-24) in their Super 12 match at Kings Park on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Tries: Gavin Lawless (2), John Allan, Adrian Garvey.</p>
<p>Conversions: Gavin Lawless (2). Penalty: Lawless.</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal - Tries: Boeta Wessels, Johan Schutte,</p>
<p>Andre Snyman. Conversions: Casper Steyn (3). Penalties: Steyn</p>
<p>(2).</p>
</text>
